flowchart TB
    PR[Pull request] --> CI[CI checks and security scan]
    CI --> ART[Immutable artifact: image, SBOM, digest]
    ART --> UAT[Staging and UAT with safe dependencies]
    UAT --> APPROVAL[Release approval and change record]
    APPROVAL --> ROLLOUT[Canary or rolling production]
    ROLLOUT --> VERIFY[Readiness, smoke tests, and business metrics]
    VERIFY -->|within budget| PROMOTE[Promote feature to 100%]
    VERIFY -->|breach| ABORT[Abort, rollback image, or disable flag]
